      ],
      "source": "https://www.martinncchamber.com/everetts/",
      "category": "history",
      "quality": "good"
    },
    {
      "id": 3,
      "text": "The former Champion Automobile Building, erected in 1919, once sold cars like Champion and Pan‑American before closing in 1930.",
